Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,A source repair. A booking you can prove.\NFor developers and accessibility QA reviewing AI-generated patches.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.00,Tag,,0,0,0,,ACCESSFINISH / WORKING DEMONSTRATION
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:20.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,The original date control was a non-focusable div.\NLoading the page did not prove the keyboard booking could finish.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.00,0:00:20.00,Tag,,0,0,0,,1 / OBSERVE THE BLOCKED TASK
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:32.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Nemotron 3 Super generated these source edits.\NThe diagnosis and repair direction were supplied. This request is recorded.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.00,0:00:32.00,Tag,,0,0,0,,2 / NEMOTRON ON NEBIUS TOKEN FACTORY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:40.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Five proposed edits. The date control becomes keyboard-editable.\NReview the source before approving execution.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.00,0:00:40.00,Tag,,0,0,0,,3 / REVIEW THE EXACT PATCH
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:46.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Deferred calendar refreshes can overwrite a typed date.\NThe stored date must match the requested task.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.00,0:00:46.00,Tag,,0,0,0,,PRESERVE THE REQUESTED DATE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:52.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Clearing the input must be safe.\NReopening the appointment must retain its date and customer data.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.00,0:00:52.00,Tag,,0,0,0,,CHECK THE WHOLE BOOKING PATH
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:58.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Approval binds the displayed patch hash to this execution.\NThe fixture is fresh, isolated, and synthetic.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.00,0:00:58.00,Tag,,0,0,0,,4 / APPROVE THIS EXACT PROPOSAL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:00:59.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,The approved proposal enters a new isolated execution.\NNo new model request is made during this capture.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.00,0:00:59.00,Tag,,0,0,0,,FRESH LOCAL EXECUTION / RECORDED MODEL PROPOSAL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.00,0:01:05.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Trusted setup prepares separate source, app, database, and reader roles.\NCandidate execution has no model key or external network.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.00,0:01:05.00,Tag,,0,0,0,,ISOLATED SYNTHETIC FIXTURE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:17.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,The patched application is compiled before the keyboard task.\NA build pass alone cannot verify the saved outcome.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.00,0:01:17.00,Tag,,0,0,0,,TRUSTED BUILD
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:18.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,A fixed native keyboard procedure completes the booking.\NConfirmation remains subject to independent outcome checks.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.00,0:01:18.00,Tag,,0,0,0,,NATIVE KEYBOARD TASK
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:38.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,A SELECT-only reader checks storage; a fresh browser reopens the booking.\NPointer booking, unavailable-slot, and preservation checks also run.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.00,0:01:38.00,Tag,,0,0,0,,INDEPENDENT OUTCOME AND REGRESSION CHECKS
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.00,0:01:48.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,The expected booking and regression checks passed for this exact run.\NThe proposal hash remains attached to its evidence.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.00,0:01:48.00,Tag,,0,0,0,,ACTUAL EXECUTION / CHECKS PASSED
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:02:02.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,November 2, 2026 · 09:00–09:30 Asia/Riyadh.\NStorage, fresh reopen, preservation, and regression controls passed.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.00,0:02:02.00,Tag,,0,0,0,,5 / VERIFIED OUTCOME FOR THIS RUN
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:12.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Two of five frozen attempts passed the full procedure.\NTwo failed to compile; one failed a calendar control after keyboard success.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.00,0:02:12.00,Tag,,0,0,0,,RETAIN THE FAILURES
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:20.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,One exposed case, with guided source generation.\NBroader repair and screen-reader validation remain open.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.00,0:02:20.00,Tag,,0,0,0,,SOURCE AND LOCAL BUILD / GITHUB.COM/SULTANALFAIFI/ACCESSFINISH
